# The rules of tools/test-changed.py: a path pattern and its targets
# (docs/design/build.md, Tests). The files of a case itself (its directory,
# its kernel test file, its test program and its script) need no rule.
# A target is a pattern of case names, a host check check-NAME,
# aarch64:PATTERN for a case on aarch64, @program for the cases that run
# the program built from the file, or none. tools/test-changed.py --check
# requires a rule for every tracked file.

# ---- files without tests ----
